        <div class="row-fluid">
        <div class="span12 op-page">

         <!-- Hero -->
         <section class="op-hero" aria-labelledby="op-title">
            <p class="op-eyebrow">Opportunities</p>
            <h2 id="op-title">Join the BioFSI Lab</h2>
            <p class="op-lead">We are looking for curious, motivated researchers to work on bio-inspired fluid mechanics, fluid&ndash;structure interaction and GPU-accelerated computational modelling at the University of Birmingham.</p>
            <nav class="op-jump" aria-label="On this page">
               <a href="#op-postdoc"><i class="fa fa-flask" aria-hidden="true"></i> Postdoctoral fellowships</a>
               <a href="#op-phd"><i class="fa fa-graduation-cap" aria-hidden="true"></i> PhD positions</a>
               <a href="#op-apply"><i class="fa fa-envelope-o" aria-hidden="true"></i> How to apply</a>
            </nav>
         </section>

         <!-- Research culture -->
         <section class="op-section" aria-labelledby="op-culture">
            <h3 class="op-h" id="op-culture">Our Research Culture</h3>
            <p class="op-intro">Our research culture rests on four core principles.</p>
            <div class="op-values">
               <div class="op-value">
                  <span class="op-icon"><i class="fa fa-lightbulb-o" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                  <h4>Innovation &amp; Discovery</h4>
                  <p>Pushing the frontiers of fluid&ndash;structure interaction, computational mechanics and bio-inspired engineering through rigorous, curiosity-driven inquiry.</p>
               </div>
               <div class="op-value">
                  <span class="op-icon"><i class="fa fa-users" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                  <h4>Collaboration</h4>
                  <p>Impactful science is collaborative. Ideas are exchanged openly across disciplines and career stages.</p>
               </div>
               <div class="op-value">
                  <span class="op-icon"><i class="fa fa-line-chart" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                  <h4>Mentorship &amp; Growth</h4>
                  <p>Structured support for the technical, intellectual and professional development of every member, from undergraduate researchers to postdoctoral scholars.</p>
               </div>
               <div class="op-value">
                  <span class="op-icon"><i class="fa fa-balance-scale" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                  <h4>Integrity &amp; Inclusion</h4>
                  <p>A respectful, diverse and ethically grounded environment where excellence and equity advance together.</p>
               </div>
            </div>
         </section>

         <!-- Postdoc -->
         <section class="op-section op-card" id="op-postdoc" aria-labelledby="op-postdoc-h">
            <div class="op-card-head">
               <span class="op-icon"><i class="fa fa-flask" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
               <h3 class="op-h" id="op-postdoc-h">Postdoctoral Fellowships</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Prospective postdoctoral scholars from around the world are warmly invited to get in touch to explore fellowship opportunities in the UK. I am happy to discuss potential projects, supervise competitive applications and advise on suitable schemes. If you are motivated to pursue high-impact research in bio-inspired fluid mechanics, fluid&ndash;structure interactions or GPU-accelerated computational modelling, please contact me to discuss possibilities and eligibility.</p>
            <p class="op-label">Schemes I can support</p>
            <ul class="op-tags">
               <li>Royal Society Newton International Fellowship</li>
               <li>MSCA Postdoctoral Fellowships</li>
               <li>Royal Society University Research Fellowship</li>
               <li>Royal Academy of Engineering Research Fellowships</li>
               <li>University-specific schemes</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="op-callout">
               <span class="op-badge">Now inviting enquiries</span>
               <h4>Royal Society Newton International Fellowship 2027</h4>
               <p>Outstanding early-career researchers based outside the UK are invited to contact me about fellowship opportunities in computational fluid dynamics, fluid&ndash;structure interaction and multiphysics modelling at the University of Birmingham.</p>
               <p class="op-deadline"><i class="fa fa-calendar" aria-hidden="true"></i> The Royal Society call is expected to close in <b>March 2027</b> (exact dates to be confirmed). Please get in touch early so there is time to develop a strong application.</p>
            </div>
         </section>

         <!-- PhD -->
         <section class="op-section op-card" id="op-phd" aria-labelledby="op-phd-h">
            <div class="op-card-head">
               <span class="op-icon"><i class="fa fa-graduation-cap" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
               <h3 class="op-h" id="op-phd-h">PhD Positions</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Dr. Bose is looking to supervise PhD projects in the following areas:</p>
            <ul class="op-tags">
               <li>Unsteady Aerodynamics</li>
               <li>Aeroelasticity</li>
               <li>Fluid&ndash;Structure Interactions</li>
               <li>Bio-Inspired Engineering</li>
               <li>Vortex Dynamics</li>
               <li>Computational Fluid Dynamics</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="op-grid">
               <div class="op-position">
                  <span class="op-badge op-badge-open">Open</span>
                  <p class="op-label">UK/EU (settled) candidates</p>
                  <h4>Propeller-Wing Wake Interactions for Urban Air Mobility Systems</h4>
                  <a class="op-btn" href="https://www.findaphd.com/phds/project/propeller-wing-wake-interactions-for-urban-air-mobility-systems/?p193733">Apply on FindAPhD <i class="fa fa-external-link" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
               </div>
               <div class="op-position op-position-alt">
                  <span class="op-badge op-badge-soft">Enquiries welcome</span>
                  <p class="op-label">International candidates</p>
                  <h4>Scholarship pathways &amp; self-funded study</h4>
                  <p>We warmly welcome international candidates to explore our open PhD positions, enquire about national scholarship pathways and discuss self-sponsored doctoral study within the group.</p>
               </div>
            </div>
            <!--h4>Recently closed positions:</h4>
         <p>
            <h5> PhD Position: <b style="color:green;">The Chaotic Voice: Nonlinear Fluid-Structure Interaction in Abnormal Phonation</b> - <a href="">Application Closed</a>.</h5>
         </p>
         <p>
            <h5> PhD Position: <b style="color:green;">Computational and Mechanistic Modelling of Porosity Effects in Eye Fluid Mechanics - Implications for Glaucoma</b> - <a href="">Application Closed</a>.</h5>
         </p-->
         </section>

         <!-- How to apply -->
         <section class="op-section op-apply" id="op-apply" aria-labelledby="op-apply-h">
            <h3 class="op-h" id="op-apply-h">How to Apply</h3>
            <ol class="op-steps">
               <li><span class="op-step-n">1</span><div><h4>Get in touch</h4><p>Email a short note about your interests and the position or scheme you have in mind.</p></div></li>
               <li><span class="op-step-n">2</span><div><h4>Send your documents</h4><p>Attach your CV and a short statement of your research interests.</p></div></li>
               <li><span class="op-step-n">3</span><div><h4>Discuss &amp; develop</h4><p>We will discuss fit and eligibility, and shape a project or fellowship application together.</p></div></li>
            </ol>
            <p class="op-cta"><a class="op-btn op-btn-lg" href="mailto:c.bose@bham.ac.uk?subject=BioFSILab%20position%20enquiry"><i class="fa fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i> Email c.bose@bham.ac.uk</a></p>
         </section>

        </div>
